  "bio": "Robyn Mahon, known professionally as Ms. Slickmahon, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the captivating watercolor and illustrative styles. Based in Salt Lake City, United States, Robyn takes pride in her craft, showcasing professionalism in both her intricate designs and her co-owned tattoo shop, Embersteel Studio. Attention to cleanliness is paramount in her practice, ensuring a safe and inviting experience for all her clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Salt Lake City, Utah, United States\n\nClinically depressed weirdo/artist and co-owner of @embersteel_studio. \nPlease do not DM me, I prefer email. Email me at robynangela22@gmail.com.",
